{
 "_doc": "The hero's own room behind the club's hall (docs/hero_room.md, plot P-HOME of tools/city/extra_places.json, building hero_room). The bed sleeps until an hour he chooses; the places for his own things, the flower pot and the switch open ULyudHeroRoom's choosers (\"open\": \"home\"); Maru's basket and the map of the coast say a line.",
